14. What is Blue-Green Deployment?
Answer
 
Blue = Current Version
 
Green = New Version
 
Deployment process:
 
Deploy Green
 
Test Green
 
Switch Traffic
 
Remove Blue
 
Used for:
✅ Zero downtime
✅ Easy rollback
