Q5. What is the biggest benefit of CI/CD?
Faster releases, automated testing, consistent deployments, reduced human error, and quicker recovery from failures.
30-Second Interview Answer
In AWS, I typically implement CI/CD using GitHub, CodePipeline/Jenkins, CodeBuild, Docker, ECR, and ECS/EKS. The pipeline automatically builds, runs unit tests, performs quality checks, creates Docker images, stores them in ECR, and deploys them to ECS or EKS. We use CloudWatch for monitoring, Secrets Manager for credentials, and Blue-Green or Canary deployments to achieve zero-downtime releases.
